#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:5
#: 19fd4a37b5e3443ab0c90e4574f4c365
msgid "Camera Triggering using Seagull MAP2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:10
#: 7b588bee1608473292a9cde06285ffc7
msgid "This article shows how connect and configure the `Seagull MAP2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map2/>`__ so that ArduPilot can trigger a camera shutter from the pilot's transmitter or during :ref:`camera missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`.  More detailed instructions are provided in the `Seagull MAP2 Manual <https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_MAP2-Manual.pdf>`__ and `Seagull MAP2 product support page <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-map2-support>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:13
#: 6348d0c615bb494380c9474fdf03769f
msgid "The list of supported cameras can be found `here on Seagull UAVs Cable Finder page <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-finder/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:15
#: a85d9026bcc541b5b641cddfbd76b81e
msgid "The board supports two trigger modes which are determined by the servo PWM output set in the :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` in Mission Planner:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:17
#: 4e13776ab7984440b83000a93d08867c
msgid "**AF-T** (\"AutoFocus-Trigger\") : 1 second pre-focus followed by trigger"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:18
#: 70fa2e6e32e4411d91344f0c01388c34
msgid "**IS-T** (\"Instant-Trigger\") : instant trigger as soon as camera locks focus"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:20
#: a263e01c45c341cf882eae5822f875d6
msgid "If used with Sony \"Multi\" cameras, Seagull MAP2 also supports turning the camera on or off  using \"Do-Set-Servo\" or \"Do-Repeat-Servo\" commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:24
#: 825838133da74cda84293d8e3cfb629b
msgid "The board also supports triggering from the RC transmitter (this is not covered in this article, but is demonstrated in the manual)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:28
#: 20fcefd4d1104c949071eca52ab5a52a
